  "ingredients": [
    "1.5 cups uncooked jasmine rice",
    "1 (14 ounce) can coconut milk",
    "1.25 cups water",
    "1 teaspoon sugar",
    "1 pinch salt",
    "1 teaspoon unrefined coconut oil"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aCTY7ix0eqIohjg4xmTrgI83h4s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/56059-asian-coconut-rice-ddmfs-5427-01-3x4-e207e527d4ee453bb4204e826afeed2c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/56059/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place rice in a fine mesh strainer, and rinse with cold water, stirring rice using your fingers to remove excess starch, until water from rice runs clear, about 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wL5Lnd-RehEzEW_PkeCumLsa_AI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/56059-asian-coconut-rice-ddmfs-5428-02-3x4-d23025a6c7814e5a851dc3bfe5e4ec1e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/56059/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place rinsed rice, coconut milk, water, sugar, and salt in a medium saucepan; stir until sugar dissolves, about 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-RO1RPvqg6LsQBxpkHgIBEWbUBY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/56059-asian-coconut-rice-ddmfs-5431-03-3x4-cb02696c8c944b4bb440025767b87295.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/56059/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring mixture in saucepan to a boil over medium heat. Cover, reduce heat to low, and simmer, undisturbed, for 11 minutes. Turn off heat; steam, covered, until rice is tender and liquid is absorbed, about 10 minutes. Uncover and gently stir in coconut oil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lymiXpEyMcLy8iEWM2f6-0zKXTk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/56059-asian-coconut-rice-ddmfs-5447-04-3x4-aec365f35a6c42bb86fffde38fdea6fa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/56059/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
